WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.360
Huh? So your brother's not coming in today?

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.690
He said he had some business to take care of.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:11.530
And to bring this.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.320
Wow! If he goes to that much
trouble for an everyday lunch,

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.450
what will your birthday next month be like?

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.660
Yeah.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.750
You'll get a full-course meal!

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.370
But I'm spending my birthday with you, right?

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.750
You sure?

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.670
That's the plan!

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.970
Yikes. Stop to chat,
and now look at the time. C'mon!

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:34.970
Yep!

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.560
Are you lost?

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.520
C'mon, over here.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:15.550
I require absolute power and an obedient pawn.

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:17.930
You are merely one of those.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:14.000
"Farandole of Reminiscence and Labyrinths"

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.010
Let me remind you:

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.300
You are not to act out of turn.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:25.260
I, the Arlond family heir,
have assumed command of everything

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.680
with regard to the forbidden grimoire.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.560
That's all well and good,
but you aren't actually <i>doing</i> anything.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:32.810
What do you mean by that?

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.610
Zero progress. Zero results.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.320
We're getting antsy here.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.610
We devils aren't the only ones
after the grimoire.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.740
Those irritating-ass
vampires want in on it, too.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.160
They are of little importance.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.830
If not for your meddling,

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.290
I would have gotten the
information out of that girl by now.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.090
I got interrupted, that's all.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:01.420
I can always try forcin' it out of her.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.930
You're not powerful enough, Mage.
I'll get her next ti--

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.850
I said, no acting out of turn!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.850
That pawn is crucial for obtaining the grimoire.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.440
Destroy it and we'll be left empty-handed.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.360
You're oddly committed to her.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.860
Do you like her?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.200
Excuse me?

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.950
Ooh, scary. I'm trembling.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:35.460
If you shut any number of snakes
together in one place,

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:39.380
they'll kill each other until only one remains.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.800
Oh, yeah, Shiki?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.340
What are you trying to say?

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:46.430
Just wondering what kind
of person'd be left standing.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.600
Why don't I use those scissors
to lop off those wings of yours?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.940
What?! What a cruel thing to say!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.610
Don't get carried away.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.730
Don't be mad.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:03.360
If you drove me out of here,
wherever would I go?

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:07.450
Wherever you want,
with those wings you're so proud of.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.200
Not you, too!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.410
See, Loewen?

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:16.120
They're all being mean to me.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.500
What? Geez!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.960
I hate you!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.640
Shiki, where are you going?

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:28.890
Beats me!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.260
Let 'im go. He just wants attention.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:37.390
Enough of that. If you have
a plan, Rem, I'd love to hear it.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:41.400
Sorry--go on ahead.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.690
I forgot my notebook.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.900
Gotcha.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.590
What are you doing?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.260
Stop that! What are you doing?!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.430
You leave me alone!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.230
It's you... from the student council.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:25.190
Shiki.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:29.450
Look, if someone's tearing up
these beautiful blooming flowers,

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.320
I can't just ignore them!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.870
So it's the flowers?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.830
Show me.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:50.180
Don't go! Don't you care
what happens to the flowers?

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.890
You told me to leave you alone!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.300
I lied.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:58.850
I thought it might get you to help me.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.230
Are all the thorns out?

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:08.190
Your handkerchief.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.610
Lend it to me.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:13.660
Here. Keep it.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.960
You don't want to leave any thorns in there.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.540
It would be marvelous.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.590
That pain would let me remember you always.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.630
Quit messing with me.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.550
Are you worried for me?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:37.060
How can I not be? You're hurt.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.360
You smell nice.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.360
Hey--

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:53.070
Everyone's so mean to me,

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.950
but you--you're kind.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.700
Everyone?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.960
They make fun of me. Because I'm an angel.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.170
You are?

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:09.420
Yes. A poor fallen angel, cast out of heaven.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.970
You and I, we're the same.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.930
I'm a human!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.800
But you're always looking for answers.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.720
Where should I go? What should I do?

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.810
Who am I?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.350
Say...

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:29.270
Didn't your <i>maman</i> Maria like flowers?

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.110
What?

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.530
She always decorated with them.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.070
Uh... yes.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:38.080
I knew it! I might just know where she went.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.330
Mom?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.410
Come on. I'll take you.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.500
What is it?

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.840
Don't you trust me?

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:58.600
I'm not like them, Rem and the others.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.060
Or...

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.810
...would you sooner trust them over me?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.980
Ritsuka! Sorry about that.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.690
What's going on?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.240
She can come, too.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.540
This way.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.540
And he's not lying about your mom?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:30.000
I don't care. Even if he is,
I want to see for myself.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.710
C'mon, we should leave.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.300
Then you leave alone.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.880
Say what?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:39.430
Ritsuka said she'd come.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:42.060
Then I will, too.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:50.650
It seems the dark ones are quite active of late.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.440
I have made efforts to dispel them.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:58.240
Lindo, we hear you have
used an unspeakable power.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.990
You must not be drawn into the darkness.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.950
I understand.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:07.830
We had word last year that the
grimoire had appeared in this area.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:11.000
Since then, its whereabouts
have remained unknown.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:16.130
Likely the dark ones' stirrings
are tied to the grimoire.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:22.100
Should anything happen, report it to us at once.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.560
I will.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.390
May divine protection be yours.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.770
Blessings upon you.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.940
Who knew there was a museum
like this so close to school?

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.660
So what's the intel on Ritsuka's mom?

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.240
Don't tell me you pulled that out of thin air.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:45.160
Do you recognize any of this art?

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.170
Who painted this?

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:54.210
I'm not too sure myself.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.250
Wait--

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.590
Shiki?

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.180
Shiki!

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:12.440
This place is for you. A maze of memories,

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.480
a museum of truth.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.780
You're sure to find what's important.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.360
Important?

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.450
Go on, now.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.880
What <i>is</i> this?

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.970
Where have I...

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:42.930
Maria--that's the butterfly's mother?

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.140
Yes. She's tracking her down.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.270
I can only take so much foot-dragging here.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:51.940
Yeah. You could never do it.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:52.980
So?

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.900
Do we know where her mother is?

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.580
That's her, all right.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.220
What?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.560
This is Grandfather's...

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.610
I-Is that--

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.530
Mom?

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:53.330
No. Aunt Marta?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.000
Ritsuka, happy birthday!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.710
Happy birthday, Ritsuka!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.720
Happy birthday!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.130
Thanks!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.770
Tonight may be the worst of it.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.440
Poor thing...

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:23.360
And Marta, too, leaving a young child behind...

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.780
Poor Lindo...

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.870
I heard them say "Lindo"...

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.410
Mama...

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:50.100
Belial. Astaroth. Echidna.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:56.270
Gusion. Eligos. Belial. Pazuzu. If...

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.690
Ifrit.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.810
Ifrit. Tannin.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.060
No way...

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:05.820
That's right, Lindo.
You must never trust a devil.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.570
You must be strong and clever

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:12.530
to keep the grimoire safe
for the Tachibana family.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.950
Grandpa!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.250
Who...

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.380
Who are you?

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.220
What was all that?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:40.520
Who was that? I... I don't know him.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:44.150
Perhaps a scene you saw once upon a time.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.190
Shiki!

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.200
Shh! Quiet.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.450
What else did you see?

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.740
Weren't you the one showing me?

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:58.160
Oh, no. I just helped.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:02.330
It was all things you had once seen around you.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.340
Where's Azuna? I'm leaving.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.300
Where to?

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.260
Home! Where else?

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.010
Is that <i>your</i> home?

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.060
Is it <i>really</i> your home?

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.390
What are you--

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:24.270
You poor thing.
Targeted by vampires and devils both.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:40.960
♪ Pathetic bunny rabbit,
tossed about by Providence ♪

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:45.380
♪ Those melancholic eyes, so pitiful ♪

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:49.630
♪ I'll take you out of all that, keep you safe ♪

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:54.390
♪ Go to sleep within my sleeves ♪

00:15:55.720 --> 00:16:00.180
♪ It's all right--I won't do a thing ♪

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:04.560
♪ Just sleep nestled up to you ♪

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.650
♪ So it won't hurt a bit ♪

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.900
♪ While your eyes are closed,
without making a sound ♪

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.400
♪ We'll mix and melt together ♪

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:17.950
♪ A lullaby for we two,
a lullaby as we hold each other ♪

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:23.250
♪ An ecstatic lullaby--see us thrill ♪

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.380
♪ Look: I am you, you are me ♪

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:31.300
♪ It's only right that it should hurt ♪

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:35.720
♪ Lovely lullaby, crazy lullaby ♪

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:40.970
♪ Eternal lullaby--now let us go ♪

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:45.400
♪ How pink the fruit; I drive my love in ♪

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:51.690
♪ It'll be over so soon--in a wink ♪

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:55.740
♪ In a tick ♪

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:02.410
No!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.460
Will you run away? I won't let you.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:13.380
Be mine... and only mine.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.810
Yes, that's the face--how it makes me shiver!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:30.070
We'll be together forever. Otherwise...

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.450
I'll kill you.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.950
Get away from her! You're disgusting!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.750
By the sacred Name, obey me,
o ye who lurk in darkness.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:54.210
Prostrate thyself before me,
and begone from here forevermore!

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:05.850
Azuna?

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.730
Get out of here, quickly.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.150
Hurry, Ritsuka!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:27.120
I have angel blood running through my veins.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:31.670
Exorcists can't defeat me.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:35.800
Exorcists? What's he talking about?

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.050
You poor thing. All alone.

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:41.640
Ritsuka, I can explain!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:47.640
Azuna... Were you being nice to me
because of the grimoire?

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.850
I won't say I wasn't. But--

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.560
Was it all about the grimoire?

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.230
Ritsuka, listen to me!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.320
If the grimoire is stolen,
terrible things will happen!

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.110
It's like Lindo said!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:02.910
So Lindo knows? That you're an exorcist?

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.410
So I'm the only one in the dark.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.620
No, Ritsuka!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.910
You poor, poor thing.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.380
Lying is a mortal sin.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.840
I won't let a liar touch you!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.300
Ritsuka!

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.180
Now it's my turn.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:27.640
By the sacred Name, obey me!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:40.740
Azu--

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.620
Now, I told you that wouldn't work.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:20:00.510
What should I do?
How shall I have you savor your agony?

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.880
No--

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:08.010
Shall I cut you open bit by bit,
then tear you apart?

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:12.940
Show me that beautiful,
beautiful grotesque face of yours.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.810
Now you'll scream instead of me.

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:19.150
Thrill me!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.070
Stop!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:26.120
Don't touch her!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.490
That woman is a liar.

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.500
Why would you stand up for her?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.210
Because she's my friend.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:33.330
Your friend?

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:38.210
Her lie was told for my sake.
That's not an evil lie!

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.880
Ritsuka...

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:46.930
I hate watching people hurt and be hurt!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.970
So stop it!

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:51.350
Ritsuka...

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.310
You're no fun.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:55.270
Okay, fine.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.070
See you later.

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.950
Wait! You said you know where my mom went--

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.740
that <i>was</i> a lie, wasn't it!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:12.830
Lies are truth. Truth, lies. You get to decide.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.750
Rem...

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:24.090
Did you put him up to that?
Did you make Shiki lie to me?

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.260
Rem, wait!

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.390
What?

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:32.520
Why did you even bring up my mother?

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:47.030
I'm no pawn.

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:51.370
I'm a person, with a heart.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.670
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:10.260
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.720
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:17.350
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:20.270
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.820
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.360
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:30.030
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.000
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:44.420
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:51.800
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:02.310
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:08.990
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:16.290
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:18.120
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:23.040
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.590
We'll open it together this time for sure.

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:32.970
An unknown world awaits you.

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:35.760
It's up to you to decide.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:41.020
"Pas de Deux of Fantasy and Innocence"

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:40.850
Act 7: Pas de Deux of Fantasy and Innocence.
